flowchart TD
    Signal[Security / privacy signal] --> Restrict[Restricted case, roles, severity]
    Restrict --> Preserve[Preserve scoped evidence and chain of custody]
    Preserve --> Contain[Stop access, exfiltration or unsafe processing]
    Contain --> Assess[Data, people, tenants, roles, countries, harm]
    Assess --> Legal{Notification / merchant / regulator duties?}
    Legal --> Notify[Approved accurate notice and deadline tracking]
    Assess --> Eradicate[Close root and adjacent paths; rotate trust]
    Eradicate --> Recover[Clean restore / correction / tenant and provider validation]
    Recover --> Monitor[Heightened monitoring and user support]
    Notify --> Monitor
    Monitor --> Learn[Controls, tests, risk, rights and follow-up]

